msgid "Workflow approaches for the RZZ angle constraint {#workflow-approaches-for-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"
msgstr "1. RZZ 각도 제약을 만족하는 매개변수 값 생성 {#1-generate-parameter-values-that-satisfy-the-rzz-angle-constraint}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "The workflow for using the fractional gates generally follows the [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow.\n"
#| "The key difference is that all RZZ angles must satisfy the constraint $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
#| "There are two approaches to ensure this condition is met.\n"
#| "This tutorial focuses on and recommends the second approach.\n"
msgid ""
"The workflow for using fractional gates generally follows the [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow.\n"
"The key difference is that all RZZ angles must satisfy the constraint $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$.\n"
"There are two approaches to ensure this condition is met, as we discuss below. We recommend the second approach, and in this tutorial, we demonstrate it through an example inspired by the quantum kernel method.\n"
"To better understand where quantum kernels are likely to be useful, we recommend reading [Liu, Arunachalam & Temme (2021)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-021-01287-z).\n"
msgstr ""
"분수 게이트 사용 워크플로우는 일반적으로 [Qiskit 패턴](/guides/intro-to-patterns) 워크플로우를 따릅니다.\n"
"핵심 차이점은 모든 RZZ 각도가 $0 < \\theta \\leq \\pi/2$ 제약 조건을 만족해야 한다는 것입니다.\n"
"이 조건을 충족시키는 두 가지 접근 방식이 있습니다.\n"
"이 튜토리얼은 두 번째 접근 방식에 초점을 맞추고 권장합니다.\n"

