msgid "You can also work through the [Quantum kernel training](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) tutorial and the [Quantum kernels](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) lesson in the Quantum machine learning course on IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
msgstr "[양자 커널 훈련](/tutorials/quantum-kernel-training) 튜토리얼과 IBM Quantum Learning의 양자 머신 러닝 과정에서 [양자 커널](/learning/courses/quantum-machine-learning/quantum-kernel-methods) 강의도 함께 살펴볼 수 있습니다.\n"

